// BT-3203: fixture host class for the extension-vs-local-method dispatch
// priority test.
//
// `localGreeting` is a real, non-intrinsic instance method that reaches the
// class's generated dispatch/3 function as an ordinary case clause — unlike
// `Integer >> +`, which is a compiler intrinsic and never reaches dispatch
// at all. The paired test registers an ETS extension for the same selector
// and confirms which one actually wins (empirically: the local method,
// same as the intrinsic case — see the test's comment for why).
//
// See test/extension_sealed_test.bt for the test.

Value subclass: Bt3203ExtensionPriorityHost

  localGreeting => "local"
